Package: konteks-remote
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ca-certificates
Maintainer: Konteks <support@konteks.example>
Homepage: https://docs.konteks.example/remote-instance
Description: Konteks native BYOA connector
 konteks-remote installs and operates one user-owned native connector with
 signed offline ACP agent packages. Harness, Validation Runtime, Assistant,
 ai-manager, databases, gateways, Docker, Compose and WSL remain absent from
 this machine. Connector-owned state is removed only by an explicit purge.
